---
// "World Wide Hype", or "Space Wide Hype" once the reader has read every story on the map (data-world, BaseHead)
---

<span class="earth">World</span><span class="space">Space</span> Wide Hype

<style>
	.space,
	:global([data-world='space']) .earth {
		display: none;
	}
	:global([data-world='space']) .space {
		display: inline;
	}
</style>
